Step 2 — Data Cleaning
Cleaning task	Code handles it?
Missing values	✅ Detects/reports
Duplicate records	✅ Removes duplicates
Invalid coordinates	✅ Detects/removes
Incorrect dates	✅ Converts/checks
Different units	⚠️ Reports data; doesn't blindly convert unknown units
Outliers	✅ Reports potential IQR outliers
Invalid geometries	✅ Detects + attempts repair
Raster nodata	✅ Checks
Raster coverage	✅ Reports valid-pixel percentage
Cloud contamination	⚠️ Not automatically from these TIFF

